  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WFP Integrated Resilience Program in the Sahel Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of the existing World Food Program Integrated Resilience Program into Benin, Cote d&apos;Ivoire, Ghana, and Togo and additional areas of existing countries Mali, Niger, Chad, Mauritania and Burkina Faso, in order to build resilience of communities to climate shocks and improve food security.</narrative>
